{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいい天気ですねっ＾＾◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"木々も色づきはじめて、\nいい季節になってきましたね～(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんブログに嬉しいことが\n書いてあったよ～ o(^o^)o"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカロンを一緒に食べたいメンバーで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま想像してみたら、\nさゆにゃんが両手でマカロン\n持ってゆっくり食べてたらすごく\nかわいいからさゆにゃん！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、答えてくれてたあ(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わあうれしいっ！食べる！マカロン！笑\n今度一緒に食べたよおねっ(*^_^*)照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、なぁちゃんブログで\nジョジョ立ちしてるよっ！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日は、ハッピーミュージックさんの\nライヴに出演させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜アリーナという大きなステージに\nすごく緊張したけど、\n楽しかったです（ミ＾０＾ミ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん有り難うございました＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハーサルだけでも、どきどき。\nお客さん入ったら、もっとどきどき((((;´･ω･`)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、ステージから見える、\nたくさんのサイリュームの光が\n本当にきれいで...\n本当に、感動しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい経験をさせてもらってるなあ..って、\nただただ感謝とうれしい気持ちでいっぱいです^o^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、まだまだ。(>_<)\nもっともっと、こういう機会が増えるよう、\n頑張っていきたいなと思いました◎◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、特別にメンバー全員で\n新曲も 披露させて\n頂いちゃいました（＾Ｏ＾）☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の乃木坂ってどこ？でも、\n初めて放送されましたが、\nダンスも激しく、かなーりカッコヨイ曲になっていて、\nわたし的には、今まででいちばん好きな曲です！(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恋愛についての歌詞になっていますが、\n実は、踏み出すことの大切さを歌っているような\n意味になっていると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46としての今のわたしたちの\n制服を着たマネキンという言葉に、\nどんな思いが込められているのか、\n考えながら聞いて頂けるとうれしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4thの制作も順調です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに＼(^o^)／ ☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おふしょっと（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/13/9629365/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}